{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01291","headline":"相和歌辞 怨诗 · 刘义","name":"相和歌辞 怨诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君莫嫌丑妇，丑妇死守贞。\n山头一怪石，长作望夫名。\n鸟有竝翼飞，兽有比肩行。\n丈夫不立义，岂如鸟兽情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘义","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}